#: ../build/src/preferences_gen.h:4565 ../tools/generate_prefs.xsl:394
msgid "privacy"
msgstr "Privacy"

#: ../build/src/preferences_gen.h:4585
msgid "Send anonymous crash reports"
msgstr "Invia dettagli crash anonimi"

#: ../build/src/preferences_gen.h:4599
msgid ""
"When Ansel crashes, automatically upload the backtrace, your operating "
"system and hardware specs (CPU, RAM, GPU), the Ansel version and crash-free "
"session statistics to the developers (via sentry.io) so the bug can be "
"fixed. No images, file names or personal data are sent. Default off; you are "
"asked once on first launch."
msgstr ""
"Quando Ansel va in crash, invia automaticamente agli sviluppatori (tramite "
"sentry.io) il backtrace, le specifiche del tuosistema operativo e "
"dell'hardware (CPU, RAM, GPU), la versione di Ansel e le statistiche "
"relative alle sessioni senza crash,in modo che il bug possa essere risolto. "
"Non vengono inviate immagini, nomi di file o dati personali. L'impostazione "
"predefinita è “disattivata”; ti verràchiesto una volta al primo avvio."

#: ../build/src/preferences_gen.h:4621
msgid "Share anonymous usage statistics"
msgstr ""

#: ../build/src/preferences_gen.h:4635
msgid ""
"Separately from crash reports, share anonymous usage statistics (which "
"modules/views/panels you use, the type of files you process, your OS and "
"hardware) with the developers via PostHog (European Union) so they know what "
"to prioritise. Data is anonymous; no images, file names or personal data are "
"sent. Default off; you are asked once on first launch."
msgstr ""

#: ../build/src/preferences_gen.h:4657
msgid "Check for newer nightly builds"
msgstr ""

#: ../build/src/preferences_gen.h:4671
msgid ""
"Once a day, fetch a small file from ansel.photos listing the newest nightly "
"build of each package format, and say so if a newer one exists for this "
"installation. Only an HTTP request with the application's version in its "
"User-Agent is made: no identifier, no usage data, and nothing to do with the "
"crash-report or statistics toggles. Only nightly builds do this; self-builds "
"and distribution packages never check."
msgstr ""

